"狡猾かつ残忍な性格で頭の回転が早く、人の心につけ込む話術も上手い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口調はくだけた感じだが、地は少し荒めで魔物らしくサディスティックな一面も持っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"220006"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"sex":[{"comparisonValue":"b","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c58738","value":"b"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10411","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10411","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"220006","value":"女"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/febc343c020dc17a5197aaadf237ce0690899662956b373d37411d5e1972752b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a7af367fb594d985c6c0a98f00726bdb22d77e0f86a2e81c7a68115d1b4a1b12.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"MARIO","creatorId":"vndb:s632","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s632","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s632","name":"紫苑 みやび","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:107365:220006:4918:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c58739","characterName":"円","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"220003","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"107365"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10408"],"vndbCharacterId":"c58739"},"originalCharacterName":"円","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"gender":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"巫女の家系に生まれたが、次女であることから不測の事態が起こらない限り巫女として後を継ぐことは無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母や姉のことは大好きだが、巫女であった母と今の巫女である姉の二人に対して密かに疎外感というかコンプレックスを抱いており、そこをミヅキにつけこまれ、憑依される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく元気な少女だが、母や姉の庇護下にいたせいか良く言えば純真、悪く言えば単純で騙されやすい。"},